      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MediaForge Video Batch: upscale\n\nRuns a long video through an upscale model a batch at a time, without holding the video in RAM.\n\n1. Pick a video on **Start Video Batch**.\n2. Pick your model in **Load Upscale Model**.\n3. Press Run. The finished video appears on **End Video Batch**, with the source's audio.\n\nOut of memory? Lower `frames_per_batch` on End. A 4x model makes each frame 16 times bigger, so it starts at 16 here."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
